  "description": "Fuaran embedded browser renderer for .NET hosts — the standalone @fuaran-ui/renderer bundle and the canonical reference stylesheet, embedded as static web assets and served by one MapFuaranRenderer() call, plus the HTML snippet that hydrates a serialized tree. Author a tree in any .NET language, serve its wire JSON, and the browser renders it live: no Node toolchain anywhere on the consumer side. Ships a fingerprint of what it embeds, and warns at development time when that disagrees with the authoring package. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
